    LLM: "Knowing the 28-tile set is essential. If the 6-6 and 5-5 are already exposed, the likelihood of a 'large' hit decreases.\n\nUse the partial-information rule to your advantage. Expose the tiles that represent common values (like 6 or 4) to keep your opponent guessing about your total rank.\n\nMathematical odds: Calculate the risk of a hit vs. the improved payoff multiplier for having more tiles in hand.",
